    what: "xtask/tests/e2e_design_flow.rs --features design-e2e - the flow e2e the epic claims as its acceptance, run at this tip: the whole flow green through three tiers, a rule-violating mockup red at its own stage, a design nobody built refusing the epic merge until the drop is recorded, and a build citing the design it read. Untouched by this WU and still green, which is the assertion - a cleanup that moved two specs and 70 docs must not move the flow's behaviour."
